# ==============================================================================
# init.dz — Raylib Complete Hybrid (OOP & Procedural) Wrapper for Djazair
#
# Provides high-level object-oriented abstractions (Window, Texture, Sound, etc.)
# alongside the standard procedural Raylib API.
#
# Author: Harizi Riyadh (hariziriyadh@gmail.com)
# ==============================================================================

